"""Replay labels generated by the foundation model, written, and reused.

The foundation is trained on waters for one epoch. A fine-tune replays other
waters through a head the foundation model relabels, beside a new head read
from its file. What is pinned: the labels are the foundation model's own
numbers and the structures they came from are left alone; a batch that fails
stops everything; the stress weight keeps its two meanings; the artifact reads
back exactly and lives in the run directory; reusing it is refused for another
model or other structures; and the configuration fills in a preset's defaults
without ever overriding a written value.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

